{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "0a2082f319b2abca9c219f4151a966eb78580344945ac54025bd976c5a01c6b8", "ja": "オトナ女子の恋愛トーク♪", "zh": "成年女子的恋爱对谈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0ed37a8da599f5d39017e8b4b7bbc1dcaaf2df1132e7ecab7c66f6b8955f14e9", "ja": "豪華な料理が届き、続いてのコーナーは、\n4人の恋愛トークをするという。\n赤裸々な発言に話が盛り上がる中、\n4 Luxuryの番組はエンディングを迎える。", "zh": "豪华的料理送了过来，接下来的环节据说要聊聊4人的恋爱话题。\n在坦率的发言让气氛越来越热烈之际，\n4 Luxury的节目迎来了尾声。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "b01c50e863ec7521594bb0f142c2ef61c60f191fafe8f622ee02e9552a413357", "ja": "さて、お悩みに答えている間に、メインのお料理が\n届いたみたい。ソムリエ厳選のワインもあるわよ～！", "zh": "那么，在回答烦恼的这段时间里，主菜好像已经送来了。还有侍酒师精心挑选的葡萄酒哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "81c3fd8942d9a33bd19adeb92fbd89854a3f75f708856cdb8b3b9b0641211f96", "ja": "知ってました、このみさん？　この赤ワイン、\nこのみさんと同じ年に作られたワインだそうです♪", "zh": "您知道吗，这个呢？这款红葡萄酒，\n据说是和这个呢同一年份酿造的哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "3b29bf2ddbc4a6e78a301c4935ab8d1291e5d79800c5d940e4d02bf94557239b", "ja": "そうなの？　粋な演出じゃない、ウフッ♪\n私と同じ年齢なら、成熟したオトナの味がするかもね。", "zh": "是吗？这安排还挺有情调的嘛，嘻♪\n要是和我同岁，说不定会有成熟大人的味道呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "06e306801e472759ed90911cbf8885c2961a9a21fb96d8bf96211d8857e18b18", "ja": "わあ～！　こっちはすごく厚みのあるお肉ですね！\n歌織さんの前にあるのは、お魚ですか？", "zh": "哇～！这边的肉看起来好厚实！\n歌织小姐面前的是鱼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1008_052kao", "source_sha256": "0bfd0d1b55412ff1b0d7152bae95ffbec24bfcc85aac4103ae70dee581e41847", "ja": "ええ、白身魚のソテーね。そうだ、麗花ちゃん。\nよかったら、あとでシェアしない？　半分こ♪", "zh": "嗯，是香煎白身鱼呢。对了，丽花。\n可以的话，待会儿要不要分着吃？一人一半♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "6411c1f77134355fc220709ab7fbcac9733c892daad93d0df936d92904fbfe7a", "ja": "いいんですか？　わーい、ありがとうございます！\nじゃあ私のパイ包み焼きも、オープンしちゃいますね♪", "zh": "可以吗？太好了，谢谢你！\n\n那我的酥皮包烤菜也要打开咯♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "e3dacc5960f9cf0bece83dc85399b1edd9a4df36df146bc5f111080dbb4c9e6d", "ja": "そういえば、ここからは麗花ちゃんにお任せって\n聞いてるんだけど……一体、何をするのかしら？", "zh": "说起来，我听说接下来要交给丽花来安排……到底要做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "b0fcc9d370f8b30d9d9ad19873aa1237886cd1c799685e13a1fdc5cd09005c4f", "ja": "はい！　みんなで恋バナをしちゃおうかなーって！", "zh": "好的！我想和大家一起聊聊恋爱话题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1014_052kao", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "77f5c376eb32c43b285005df3c0a19ebf8829681e7d0f619ed14135d64186d08", "ja": "風花さんは、どんなタイプの男性が好きですか？\n楽しみだな～♪　ワクワク♪", "zh": "风花小姐喜欢什么类型的男性呢？\n好期待啊～♪　好激动♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ac4498a6c1976d8ce128c3e9219809d005646e70b31613240e4ff4917df06376", "ja": "ええっ！？　わ、私からっ！？\nなんだか麗花ちゃんの視線がすごく痛い……ううっ。", "zh": "诶！？要、要从我开始吗！？\n总觉得丽花的视线好有压迫感……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "e909e0e4c2e7af39e59d1f5490ff884fd14696afdc3b135641ab2179b84d9de6", "ja": "あっ！　私、わかっちゃったかもしれません！\n風花さんの好きなタイプは……。", "zh": "啊！我好像已经猜到了！\n风花喜欢的类型是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "026bdc1793e4d7185c2f9baaaf952199e5846a31a5164344009397bde74976ad", "ja": "れ、麗花ちゃん！！\nそういう麗花ちゃんはあるの？　好きなタイプ！", "zh": "丽、丽花！！\n那丽花你呢？喜欢的类型！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1019_048rei", "source_sha256": "c08dee7a053511ecb980ad32c9e14b76c2d30fc92ee9e02b0e0516fe495930b0", "ja": "はい、ありますよ。\n私は、ザ・普通って感じの人がタイプです！", "zh": "有啊。\n我喜欢那种给人感觉特别普通的人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1020_052kao", "source_sha256": "65ccc1d3f5a97dfdc798a501e38a19dfbae83dd5ac819a85319abdfb2d99d61a", "ja": "まぁ。それってつまり……。\n好きな方のタイプが幅広いってことなのかしら？", "zh": "哎呀。也就是说……\n你喜欢的类型其实很广泛吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1021_048rei", "source_sha256": "abc627178cc3e856ebead943a0b340d8291503f866b0439bf903104f79222baa", "ja": "そんなことありませんよ？\n普通の人って、探してみると、意外と見つからなくて。", "zh": "不是那样哦？\n要找普通人，其实意外地不容易找到呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1022_039kon", "source_sha256": "e8885a28fd6216dcf0662d5fac32a5fe794525f546f9b516e2272548256814dd", "ja": "なるほど、深いわね……。ん？　探してる？\nやっぱり探してるのね、麗花ちゃん！？", "zh": "原来如此，还真深奥呢……嗯？你在找人？\n果然是在找吧，丽花！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1023_048rei", "source_sha256": "74706be6dbb9a32d8201f57d2336184c69f7dc6f70bc1734105702c039c94900", "ja": "ふふっ、ノーコメントです♪\nこのみさんは、どうですか？　気になるな～！", "zh": "呵呵，不予置评♪\n那么，这位女士呢？真让人在意呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1024_039kon", "source_sha256": "62eefcfbe3677b44127a91205ab230a7dee7e9db86d1fdff4e2934e928182b5c", "ja": "ぐっ、まさかの切り返し……。\nまあ、私の場合は、当然アダルティ溢れる人がいいわ！", "zh": "呃，没想到你会这么回……。\n嗯，我的话，当然是喜欢那种浑身散发着成熟魅力的人啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1025_048rei", "source_sha256": "446d042b36faadafc9fb4948ea9e985b2dfea9b23c23fff5fc24d07ed87b7ea7", "ja": "なるほど、おじいさんですね？\nみなさん、とってもアダルティです♪", "zh": "原来如此，是老爷爷对吧？\n大家都非常成熟呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1026_039kon", "source_sha256": "89e3d581f686fb1cc61ba75a03ba5a00cd5e4cabd8f896a500a4cee5cb9939ae", "ja": "そ……そうね。\nええ、包容力はあるものね、間違ってないわ。", "zh": "是……是啊。\n嗯，确实很有包容力，说得没错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1027_048rei", "source_sha256": "900fc3ee312c96258d3fb72224cd356d43ea54403a5bbefeb9e93d1b899fc3e0", "ja": "はい！　次は……歌織さんの番ですね！\n好きな男性のタイプをどうぞ～！", "zh": "是的！接下来……轮到歌织小姐了！\n请说说你喜欢的男性类型吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1028_052kao", "source_sha256": "c2774eb6c033a8629d7de4177086e2c7b9e66b5aafb19260d740ee1889ba15df", "ja": "えっと……ごめんなさい、麗花ちゃん。\n私なりに考えてみたんだけど、何も浮かばなくて……。", "zh": "那个……对不起，丽花。虽然我也认真想过了，可是什么都想不出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1029_052kao", "source_sha256": "eca03c7cafb4a3e1778caa851ac3496122e09c102383b7a8032110dfa1368643", "ja": "そういうことも考えなくちゃって思うんだけど、今は、\nみんなと一緒にお仕事をするのが、すごく楽しいの。", "zh": "我也觉得必须考虑那些事情，可是现在，能和大家一起工作，我真的特别开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1030_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a22a9e75d1b45a7fbb461903c5ab538b18e651ee13a5d971d785c7688c13b8c0", "ja": "歌織さん……。", "zh": "歌织小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1031_048rei", "source_sha256": "c6da5bce9202ceddf561fd2fc031c82cb3fe1eab8527cc38654d70fd41dd0eb7", "ja": "それなら、歌織さんのタイプは、\n私たちを応援してくれるファンのみんなですね！", "zh": "既然这样，歌织小姐喜欢的类型就是为我们加油的粉丝们吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1032_052kao", "source_sha256": "6a60b1f35a05f6e54429ffbfc9b8943f9243bcf31542e2367f5e9583578f1a27", "ja": "ふふっ、そうね。麗花ちゃんのいうとおりだわ。\nはい、最後は風花ちゃんの番♪", "zh": "呵呵，是呢。正如丽花所说。好，最后轮到风花啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1033_041fuk", "source_sha256": "edb3ef9a7d6f007de89cefaa724fe1946acad9d801a4cffaa8cb1243eb530f9a", "ja": "は、はいっ！　なんていえばいいのか、ずっと考えてた\nんですけど、恥ずかしくて……でも、思い切って……！", "zh": "是、是的！我一直在想该怎么说才好，可是觉得很害羞……不过，我还是鼓起勇气……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1034_039kon", "source_sha256": "337f84c41f5890a90bbab0e756ee87e2ca751bbf4b9f05c33c2795721bbccdb9", "ja": "はい！　悪いんだけど、\nそろそろお別れの時間みたいなの。", "zh": "好的！虽然很抱歉，好像差不多到了该告别的时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1035_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9a7150f62ad631ff6d4777d25d9fc92ffff93f382f97b37ac1cd63cf960a66d5", "ja": "ええっ！？　せっかく思い切ったのに……。\nうう、わかりました～。", "zh": "诶！？明明好不容易鼓起勇气了……  \n呜呜，我知道了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1036_052kao", "source_sha256": "54ded90cbd4a9bdd8fa1a831d3e43bd63b0949a770df953ab3f9620b2553f742", "ja": "エンディングでデザートをいただけるそうです♪\nえ？　あちらで、って……まあ、ビュッフェ形式で？", "zh": "听说结束时可以吃甜点♪\n诶？在那边吃……原来是自助餐形式？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1037_048rei", "source_sha256": "1b280f0660d28167e7538a66f6d85c80f153a716cb49f39b71071f0187690ada", "ja": "わあ～！　どんなのがあるんだろう～？\n私もリサーチしてきます！　レッツゴ～♪", "zh": "哇～！会有什么样的甜点呢～？\n我也要去打探一下了！出发喽～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1038_039kon", "source_sha256": "58eec75779e90beb741856cbb25a9d4a8edcfa8d23aeffabc24a354ca4b1f727", "ja": "オトナ女子たるもの、スイーツには勝てないわよね～。\n……あ、そうそう。最後に、みんなにお知らせよ！", "zh": "作为成熟女性，果然还是无法抵抗甜点呢～。\n……啊，对了对了。最后还有件事要通知大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0170_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_04_1039_039kon", "source_sha256": "4ed01dfb6fc253c5a8cf724ab5d2f7944811954938cf1c79fd084477ae7c4932", "ja": "私たち、4 Luxuryのリバイバル公演が決定したの！\n詳しくは、劇場のブログやSNSをチェックしてね♪", "zh": "我们，4 Luxury的复演已经确定啦！\n详情请关注剧场的博客和社交媒体哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
